---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="pepprime | Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for pepprime website.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 prose-policy">
    <div class="label-pill">Policy</div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4">Effective date: [Insert date]</p>
    <p>At pepprime, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the information you share through our website.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect your name, email address, phone number or WhatsApp contact, shipping country or destination details, inquiry content, and standard website usage information.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>Information may be used to respond to inquiries, discuss product and pricing details, coordinate shipping communication, improve website performance, and maintain reasonable internal records.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
    <p>The website may use cookies or similar technologies to improve functionality and understand visitor activity. Browser settings can usually be used to manage cookie preferences.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell personal information. Information may be shared only when reasonably required for communication, logistics support, legal compliance, or protection of business operations.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact info@pepprime.com.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
